      "id": "claim_7b719c0f048d493b8da94b8872785cd9",
      "statement": "LearnedLimit.of judges which bound held back a topic's learned adjustment in precedence order LEARNED_CAP (uncapped thumbs points reach learnedCap) > SIGN_CLAMP (base+learned, i.e. thumbs plus engagement combined, would cross zero) > WEIGHT_RANGE (|base+learned| exceeds 50) > ENGAGEMENT_CAP (uncapped engagement points reach engagementCap, via the shared engagementAtCap predicate, only checked when no earlier bound applied) > NONE; engagementAtCap is also reported independently by the learned-topics API regardless of which limit LearnedLimit.of ultimately returns.",
